  "notes": [
    "**Descansar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **descansado** (regular)",
    "Common usage: *descansar un poco* (to rest a bit), *descansar bien* (to rest well)",
    "Related noun: **el descanso** (rest, break)",
    "Expression: *¡Que descanses!* (Rest well! / Sleep well!)",
    "Common phrase: *Descansar en paz* (to rest in peace - RIP)",
    "Can also mean \"to be based on\": *Su argumento descansa en hechos* (His argument rests on facts)"
